WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.892 --> 00:00:04.694
Ben looked out the window of the school bus.

2
00:00:04.774 --> 00:00:14.879
A man wearing a gray suit and red tie was hurrying toward them.

3
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:31.989
"Welcome to People Place," he called in a friendly voice.

4
00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:35.170
"My name is Al—Al Normal."

5
00:00:36.711 --> 00:00:38.931
The monsters slowly climbed off the bus.

6
00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:49.396
"I'm the museum director's assistant," the man continued cheerfully.

7
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:53.377
"I'm going to show you monsters all around the museum.

8
00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:59.920
I'm sure your overnight stay in our new education wing will be really great!"

9
00:01:00.976 --> 00:01:02.898
Mog looked around in confusion.

10
00:01:02.918 --> 00:01:05.380
"Where are all the cobwebs?"

11
00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:06.380
he asked.

12
00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:10.784
A vampire was squinting and searching for her sunglasses.

13
00:01:14.526 --> 00:01:16.408
too bright here for me."

14
00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:20.671
Mr. Freaky flapped his arms nervously.

15
00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:24.674
"Now, students remember your monster manners, please!

16
00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:26.836
We are guests in People Place."

17
00:01:30.724 --> 00:01:32.145
"Stay calm, Mr.

18
00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:34.227
Freaky," Miss Bungle said.

19
00:01:34.247 --> 00:01:37.631
"Everything is totally under control."

20
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:41.134
"Ugh!" a monster burst out.

21
00:01:41.154 --> 00:01:44.878
"That part of the museum looks so new and shiny!"

22
00:01:44.898 --> 00:01:48.721
Al Normal beamed with pride.

23
00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:52.625
"Yes, we've just had a major renovation.

24
00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.328
Isn't our building beautiful?

25
00:01:56.368 --> 00:02:01.830
Some sections are still under construction, of course, but the work is nearly finished.

26
00:02:03.111 --> 00:02:07.152
You'll all have to come back for the dedication ceremony in the spring."

27
00:02:07.172 --> 00:02:10.794
"It's a very nice building," Ben said.

28
00:02:10.814 --> 00:02:13.255
"The museum looks really cool."

29
00:02:13.275 --> 00:02:15.376
"Thank you."

30
00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:17.397
Al Normal nodded at Ben.

31
00:02:17.417 --> 00:02:25.140
"The construction crew is still working on the area between the education wing and the main part of

32
00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.937
the museum," he explained.

33
00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:30.699
"I'm very sorry about any inconvenience.

34
00:02:31.199 --> 00:02:34.521
But the classrooms where you'll be spending the night are finished.

35
00:02:35.261 --> 00:02:39.684
They are ready for your stay, and I think you'll be very comfortable there."

36
00:02:40.644 --> 00:02:43.085
Mr. Freaky was looking around with a frown.

37
00:02:43.105 --> 00:02:48.428
"I thought that the museum director was supposed to meet us when we arrived," he said.

38
00:02:48.448 --> 00:02:52.170
"Mayor Hubbletree indicated that she'd be here to greet us."

39
00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.464
"Um, Dr.

40
00:02:55.504 --> 00:03:01.187
Bones had to deal with some last-minute museum issues," Al Normal explained.

41
00:03:01.207 --> 00:03:05.109
"And Mayor Hubbletree will be here very soon.

42
00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:10.192
We'll meet the director right after I show you our new education wing.

43
00:03:10.813 --> 00:03:14.835
I think you monsters will be very impressed with what you see."

44
00:03:14.855 --> 00:03:20.798
"I'm sure the education wing is beautiful," Miss Bungle replied politely.

45
00:03:21.678 --> 00:03:24.280
She turned to the group of Monster Academy students.

46
00:03:25.064 --> 00:03:27.165
"Monsters! Please line up.

47
00:03:27.545 --> 00:03:29.245
It's time to start the tour."

48
00:03:30.266 --> 00:03:31.946
Mr. Freaky looked startled.

49
00:03:31.966 --> 00:03:35.067
"I-it is?"

50
00:03:35.467 --> 00:03:36.087
he stammered.

51
00:03:36.107 --> 00:03:38.388
"Oh yes!

52
00:03:38.828 --> 00:03:39.188
It is!

53
00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:41.309
Nothing to be afraid of, students!

54
00:03:41.689 --> 00:03:45.490
Everything is totally—" "Under control!"

55
00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.390
shouted a few monsters.

56
00:03:49.431 --> 00:03:51.972
The group followed Al Normal into the museum.

57
00:03:53.212 --> 00:03:55.793
Gaby ducked so that she wouldn't hit her head on the door.

58
00:04:07.478 --> 00:04:09.119
A monster wrinkled his nose.

59
00:04:09.139 --> 00:04:13.580
"It's all so er, new!"

60
00:04:14.121 --> 00:04:15.741
he said, looking around.

61
00:04:16.642 --> 00:04:18.923
The vampire wearing sunglasses shuddered.

62
00:04:18.943 --> 00:04:26.359
"Wow. The lights are even brighter in here," she moaned.

63
00:04:26.379 --> 00:04:34.066
"We're very proud of this new addition to the museum," Al Normal was saying.

64
00:04:34.086 --> 00:04:38.429
"Everything is quite modern and up-to-date.

65
00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.452
We even have solar power cells on the roof."

66
00:04:42.472 --> 00:04:46.936
"You have solar power!"

67
00:04:47.396 --> 00:04:49.078
The vampire gasped in horror.

68
00:04:49.098 --> 00:04:51.380
"Isn't that dangerous?

69
00:04:51.976 --> 00:04:53.317
It sounds awful."

70
00:04:53.337 --> 00:04:54.697
"Oh no.

71
00:04:55.177 --> 00:04:57.558
It's not dangerous," Al Normal said.

72
00:04:57.578 --> 00:05:01.060
"It's very safe and very clean as well."

73
00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:04.721
"It's good for the environment," Ben chimed in.

74
00:05:04.741 --> 00:05:09.463
"Mr. Creepy said that's helpful for people and monsters."

75
00:05:10.404 --> 00:05:13.885
The vampire nodded slowly, but she still looked uneasy.

76
00:05:16.806 --> 00:05:24.794
A long hallway was cluttered with construction equipment—metal pipes, scaffolding, tools, paint cans, and ladders.

77
00:05:25.815 --> 00:05:28.597
Ben could see that a new wall was being constructed.

78
00:05:28.617 --> 00:05:31.559
"What's going on there?"

79
00:05:32.039 --> 00:05:34.441
Mr. Freaky asked, pointing to the mess.

80
00:05:35.522 --> 00:05:36.603
Al Normal frowned.

81
00:05:36.623 --> 00:05:39.625
"I'm sorry about that, Mr.

82
00:05:39.705 --> 00:05:43.888
Freaky. As I mentioned, the building isn't quite finished.

83
00:05:44.688 --> 00:05:50.132
And unfortunately, that construction blocks our access to the main part of the museum.

84
00:05:50.984 --> 00:05:55.066
So we'll have to go around to the main entrance to see the exhibits.

85
00:05:55.986 --> 00:05:58.627
But first, we'll view the education wing.

86
00:05:59.548 --> 00:06:04.030
After that we can go upstairs to the director's new office and meet her."

87
00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.050
He smiled at the monsters.

88
00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:09.952
"Does anyone have any questions so far?"

89
00:06:09.972 --> 00:06:11.513
"I do!

90
00:06:11.893 --> 00:06:12.333
I do!"

91
00:06:12.733 --> 00:06:14.074
A monster waved his hand.

92
00:06:14.094 --> 00:06:17.315
"Yes?" said Al Normal pleasantly.

93
00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:19.136
"When's dinner?"

94
00:06:19.616 --> 00:06:20.836
the monster blurted out.

95
00:06:20.856 --> 00:06:24.818
"Yeah!" Mog chimed in, rubbing his belly.

96
00:06:24.838 --> 00:06:27.479
"I'm really hungry."

97
00:06:27.499 --> 00:06:31.320
"Er Al Normal quickly checked his watch.

98
00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:32.740
"Let's see.

99
00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.562
We have a busy schedule, but I think we can eat dinner around—Eek!"

100
00:06:38.562 --> 00:06:42.183
He shrieked in horror as a hairy creature sprang at his face!
